<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A6" title="In Self-Anchor: Large Language Model Reasoning via Step-by-step Attention Alignment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">F </span>Case Study</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A7" title="In Self-Anchor: Large Language Model Reasoning via Step-by-step Attention Alignment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">G </span>Numerical Experiment Result on Big-Bench-Hard</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
